{"id": "EUVD-2026-101728", "enisaUuid": "24775d84-ff0c-3474-adf9-c05369ece432", "description": "n8n before 1.123.83, 2.x before 2.41.4, and 2.42.x before 2.42.1 contains a code execution vulnerability in the Git node Log operation, which fails to strip a repository's local git configuration before invoking an external program. Authenticated members who can point the node, including as an agent tool, at a repository whose local configuration they control can execute programs as the n8n process user.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T22:52:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T22:52:20", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/security/advisories/GHSA-x8wx-g24x-3549", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/n8n-before-1.123.83-2.41.4-and-2.42.1-code-execution-via-git-node-log-operation"], "aliases": ["GHSA-qgh4-pf6j-6hwh", "CVE-2026-110845"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "513dbc53-4bec-3069-bae2-e7a607083e6a", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.42.0 <2.42.1"}, {"id": "65ba09c2-26e7-3cc6-83ee-3b2bb4543854", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.41.4"}, {"id": "fae3e863-824f-346e-9a62-6a7900854117", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.123.83"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5aff81e8-2e9c-39fe-a3f2-f64278be8922", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}], "isExploited": false}